#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:385
msgid ""
"The Default Country Code is used to format numbers that don't include an "
"international prefix (e.g., +358).\n"
"\n"
"If left empty, the system tries to detect it automatically from your SIM "
"card or network.\n"
"\n"
"You can manually override it here by entering a 2-letter ISO region code (e."
"g. US, FI, DE) or a calling code (e.g. +358, 358, +1, 1)."
msgstr ""
"Kod Negara Lalai digunakan untuk memformat nombor yang tidak termasuk awalan "
"antarabangsa (mis., +358).\n"
"\n"
"Jika dibiarkan kosong, sistem cuba mengesannya secara automatik daripada kad "
"SIM atau rangkaian anda.\n"
"\n"
"Anda boleh menggantikannya secara manual di sini dengan memasukkan kod "
"rantau ISO 2 huruf (cth. AS, FI, DE) atau kod panggilan (cth. +358, 358, +1, "
"1)."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:413
msgid ""
"Carriers limit how large a multimedia message can be. Images and videos you "
"attach are automatically compressed to fit under this limit before sending.\n"
"\n"
"Automatic uses the limit reported by the phone's MMS service, which is right "
"for most carriers. Pick a smaller value if your messages fail to send, or a "
"larger one if you know your carrier allows it."
msgstr ""
"Pembekal perkhidmatan mengehadkan saiz mesej multimedia. Imej dan video yang "
"anda lampirkan akan dimampatkan secara automatik supaya muat di bawah had "
"ini sebelum dihantar.\n"
"\n"
"Automatik menggunakan had yang dilaporkan oleh perkhidmatan MMS telefon, "
"yang sesuai untuk kebanyakan pembekal. Pilih nilai yang lebih kecil jika "
"mesej anda gagal dihantar, atau nilai yang lebih besar jika anda tahu "
"pembekal anda membenarkannya."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:435
msgid ""
"The ringback tone is the sound played (toot-toot-toot) while waiting for an "
"outgoing call to be answered. Some carriers don't generate it so we have "
"option to generate it manually here. \n"
"\n"
"You can select your own music file, or clear it to use the standard system "
"tone."
msgstr ""
"Nada dering balik ialah bunyi yang dimainkan (toot-toot-toot) sementara "
"menunggu panggilan keluar dijawab. Sesetengah pembawa tidak menjananya jadi "
"kami mempunyai pilihan untuk menjananya secara manual di sini. \n"
"\n"
"Anda boleh memilih fail muzik anda sendiri, atau mengosongkannya untuk "
"menggunakan nada sistem standard."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:455
msgid "Select Ringback Tone"
msgstr "Pilih Nada Dering Balik"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:463
msgid "Audio Files"
msgstr "Fail Audio"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:489
msgid ""
"Select the address books to use with Telephony and arrange them in order of "
"priority. The topmost address book has the highest priority and will be "
"preferred if a number is found in multiple address books. You can use the "
"Duplicate Resolver toggle below to help manage duplicates, but even if "
"disabled, we encourage enabling it for a better experience."
msgstr ""
"Pilih buku alamat untuk digunakan dengan Telephony dan susunkannya mengikut "
"keutamaan. Buku alamat paling atas mempunyai keutamaan tertinggi dan akan "
"diutamakan jika nombor ditemui dalam berbilang buku alamat. Anda boleh "
"menggunakan togol Penyelesai Pendua di bawah untuk membantu mengurus pendua, "
"tetapi walaupun dilumpuhkan, kami menggalakkan mendayakannya untuk "
"pengalaman yang lebih baik."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:508
msgid ""
"When enabled, if the same phone number calls you 3 times within 5 minutes, "
"the third call (and subsequent ones within the window) will force the phone "
"to ring at maximum volume, bypassing Silent or Do Not Disturb modes."
msgstr ""
"Apabila didayakan, jika nombor telefon yang sama memanggil anda 3 kali dalam "
"masa 5 minit, panggilan ketiga (dan panggilan seterusnya dalam tetingkap) "
"akan memaksa telefon berdering pada volum maksimum, memintas mod Senyap atau "
"Jangan Ganggu."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:520
msgid ""
"Choose contacts that will always play notifications at full volume, even "
"when the phone is in Silent or Do Not Disturb mode."
msgstr ""
"Pilih kenalan yang akan sentiasa memainkan pemberitahuan pada kelantangan "
"penuh, walaupun semasa telefon berada dalam mod Senyap atau Jangan Ganggu."

